## Project Status

- **Stage:** Development
- **Current Sprint:** Homepage
- **Current Priority:** Sincerest Letter (complete) → Portfolio (next)
- **Framework:** Next.js 15 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS 3 + Framer Motion
- **Build:** ✅ Compiled successfully

---

## Components Built

### Navbar — Final State

- Fixed position, 72px height, black text (#111111) static
- Logo (150x92) on the left, 10px top margin
- Page constrained to 260px padding left and right
- Nav items: About, Portfolio, Research, Network, 209px gap, right-aligned (ml-auto)
- Inter 13px/400, letter-spacing 0.04em, 80% opacity
- Hover: scale-125 + opacity-100, 250ms ease

### Hero Section — Final State

- Full viewport (100vh, min 900px), overflow hidden
- Background image (bg-hero.png) fills right 2/3 of viewport, right-top aligned
- Headline: "BUILDING CLARITY, / IN COMPLEXITY." — Cormorant Garamond 300, 64px, uppercase, letter-spacing 0.16em, drop-shadow, #111111
- Keywords: "Data • Logic • Insight" — Cormorant Garamond 300, 24px, #222222, opacity-70, black square bullets
- Animation: fade + translateY 12px, 2s easeIn (headline), 3s delay (keywords), Framer Motion

### Sincerest Letter — Final State

- Two-block continuous composition: black (#000000) top block + white (#FFFFFF) bottom block
- Profile image (profile-pic.png) — left column, 45% width, bottom-aligned, 50px offset from bottom
- Title: "SINCEREST LETTER" — Cormorant Garamond 300, 64px, uppercase, white
- Subtitle: "Introducing me, Ahsan" — Inter 18px + Cormorant Garamond Italic 28px
- Body: 3 justified paragraphs, Inter 300, 16px, white, line-height 1.8, max-w 580px
- Signature asset (signature.png) — right-aligned below body
- Signature text: "Ahsan Rizqullah / Founder of Quantfun Technologies" — Cormorant Garamond 12px
- Pillar (pillar.png) — absolute positioned, 50px from left, scale 0.6, bottom-aligned, spans both sections
- Philosophy heading in bottom white block, content right-aligned (55% width, ml-auto)
- 64px padding top and bottom on content column
- Animations: fade-in on pillar only (Framer Motion)

## Structure

- `src/app/` — Next.js App Router pages and layout
- `src/components/layout/` — Navbar
- `src/components/sections/` — Hero, SincerestLetter
- `Design/` — Design specs and references
- `Memory/` — Persistent project identity and principles
- `public/img/` — Static image assets

## Commands

```
npm run dev    Start development server
npm run build  Production build
npm run start  Start production server
npm run lint   Run linter
```
